	(descr "Ruishen RSPQ2918 series flat-wire power inductor (RSPQ2918-100M, LCSC C32712982), 27.9 x 27.9 mm max overall (the body 27.9 x 22.7 with the terminal pair standing 5.2 mm out of one side: the top view's 27.9 max height spans body and leads, LCSC's package field 27.9x22.7mm), 18.0 mm max high. Source: the maker's approval sheet RSPQ2918 series, version A0, 2023-04-14, page 2 (served by LCSC as the part's datasheet, https://datasheet.lcsc.com/datasheet/pdf/13a041f28fe6251173becd9356b9f32f.pdf?productCode=C32712982): 'Reference PCB pattern' drawing (an image, read by eye 2026-11-26): one pad 6.4 x 5.3, two pads 5.3 wide with a 4.8 gap, 27.5 overall pattern span, 5.3 / 5.1 / 9.9 vertical stack from the single pad's outer edge to the pair's inner edge; the pair's height (7.2) is the span's remainder. Pins (re-read 2026-11-29, PLANS/2026-11-28-speaker-board-open-list.md section 5): pads 1 and 2 = the pair = the winding's two ends, pad 3 = the single pad = a mounting pad with NO electrical connection. The sheet numbers no pins, but its side view draws the flat-wire helix with its bottom turn going down to one of the pair's leads and its top turn down a post to the other, both at the base on the pair's side; and the Bourns PQ2614 sheet (the same construction: two 3.8 mm leads 6.6 apart on one side, one pad opposite) labels its single pad 'MOUNTING PAD (DO NOT MAKE ELECTRICAL CONNECTION)' (references/speaker-dsp-board/downloads/datasheets/bourns_pq2614bha.txt:84-90). The 2026-11-26 staging had it the other way round (the pair one terminal, the single pad the other: the winding shorted, the inductor out of circuit). Which end is pad 1 does not matter (no polarity on the sheet); a DMM across the pair of a sample confirms it before the first build. Origin: the centre of the 27.9 x 27.9 overall outline; the 27.5 mm pattern centred in it, the pair under the protruding leads. Re-drawn 2026-11-26 (PLANS/2026-11-26-speaker-board-size.md): the first staging took the body as 27.9 square and put the pair 3.15 mm outside it, a courtyard 3.15 mm too long. Staged 2026-11-26 for boards/modules/amp_channel (PLANS/2026-11-26-speaker-board-cost-down.md).")
	(tags "inductor flat wire Ruishen RSPQ2918 class D output")
